# What Ruumble Client is built from besides this repo. Ruumble itself is the submodule server/ (ruumble-server).
# Mumble is cloned into work/ from MUMBLE_URL at MUMBLE_REF. MUMBLE_REPO may name a local Mumble checkout instead
# (absolute, or relative to the repo root); it is only read. Each value can be overridden from the environment.
MUMBLE_REPO=${MUMBLE_REPO:-}
MUMBLE_URL=${MUMBLE_URL:-https://github.com/mumble-voip/mumble.git}
MUMBLE_REF=${MUMBLE_REF:-v1.6.870}
